              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi mushikulu muno OMWAMI omwene mahe alabakholela abetsimbia tsiosi lisabo liebinulu, lisabo lietsidivai tsindulu, liebinulu ebiitsuulemwo obutunduli, lietsidivai tsindulu tsinzeleleshe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mushikulu muno alarusiaho eshifuunikho eshifuuniishe tsimbia tsiosi tsiabandu, nende olububi olufuumile amahanga kosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 25:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwami NYASAYE aleeyanga amasika mumoni mwabandu bosi; khandi amanyeko kabandube alakayiniaho okhurula khushialo shiosi; okhuba OMWAMI niye owaliboolile.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.8",
